  "name": "Relais",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "about": "Relais, the email desk's look. Poste's structure and colour (postal navy ink on cool blue-grey paper, the airmail stripe, monospace for numbers and addresses) with Courrier's rounder corners and type: Instrument Sans for the interface, Newsreader for the letters people send. Airmail red marks only what needs attention. Written in Discothèque's variable names, so component CSS needs no mapping; scripts/build.mjs writes it to css/relais.css under data-look='relais'.",
